The GreenCounty_db folder contains a selection of elements specific to Green County 
that were originally located in the db folder. This makes it easier for me to update 
the mission files, which are partly based on those from Livonia.

Do not delete this folder, as doing so may break certain game mechanics and the 
economy of Green County. These files are called in cfgeconomycore.xml file.

Further information on this process:
https://community.bistudio.com/wiki/DayZ:Central_Economy_mission_files_modding 